payer.description:
Is Payer Configured. A toggle controlling whether the payment_* series of fields are displayed/submitted;
mutually exclusive with payee (only one of the two can be enabled, unless the data
source allows both).

bookingTypeId.description:
Booking Type ID. Bookkeeping business type, a dropdown selection (cascading with the data source);
values come from the pg_book_types_pickid_v2 dynamic enumeration and are not fixed.

Call `GET /v1/datasets/refs/book_business_types_by_source` to retrieve the current data dictionary, and use the returned entry's `key` as this field's value.

sourceId.description:
Book Source. A dropdown selection; values come from the pg_book_source dynamic enumeration;
disabled and not editable in edit mode; converted to a number before submission.

Call `GET /v1/datasets/refs/book_source` to retrieve the current data dictionary, and use the returned entry's `key` as this field's value.
